'''Goddess of Abundance - Freya''' (豊穣の女神フレイヤ, ''Hōjō no Megami Fureiya'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Goddess of Abundance - Freya
|appearance = [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 203.png
|money drop = 1,250円 - 4,937円
}}

==Enemy==
High health, extremely pitiful attack and overall poor stats for an enemy. Goddess of Abundance - Freya is more of a support enemy, being able to slow the players [[Cat Units]] for four seconds, however take note that she isn't guaranteed to slow giving the player a chance to attack her if it doesn't proc.<br>
In the [[Valhalla Battle|first stage]] she appears her support role and slow will barely do anything as the stage is rather easy, for the [[The End is Coming?! Nyagnarok!|final stage]] is somewhat the same but she acts more of a tank with 330,000 health!

==Strategy==
There's the obvious choice of [[Cat Units]] that are [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]] such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]], [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cupid Cat]] and many more, however if your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] are around about level 30, you can conquer her debut stage [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|three]] [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|normal]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|units]]!

